  "poc_markdown": "# ACME Retail - Edge Virtualization PoC\n\n> SUSE → ACME Retail S.A. · Generated by PoC Planner v1.0.0 · 2026-11-13\n\n## Project\n\n- Lead engineer: Ana Souza (ana.souza@example.com)\n- Start: 2026-11-02 · Target date: 2026-11-20\n- Use case: VM modernisation and platform consolidation for retail stores\n- Business issue: The current hypervisor licence renews in Q1 and per-socket costs doubled; the team wants one Kubernetes-based platform for VMs and containers.\n- Target infrastructure: 3 x 2U servers (16 cores, 64 GB RAM, 2 x 250 GB SSD + 500 GB data disk, 4 x 10 GbE) in the Sao Paulo lab, top-of-rack switches with trunked ports.\n\n### Client contacts\n\n| Name | Role | E-mail | Phone |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Carlos Lima | IT Infrastructure Manager | carlos.lima@acme.example | +55 11 5550-0101 |\n| Marina Costa | Security Architect | marina.costa@acme.example | +55 11 5550-0102 |\n| Rafael Dias | Network Engineer | rafael.dias@acme.example | +55 11 5550-0103 |\n\n## Scope\n\n- SUSE Virtualization\n- Rancher Prime\n- SUSE Security\n- SUSE Storage\n- SUSE Observability\n- SUSE Private Registry\n- SUSE Application Collection\n- SUSE Multi-Linux Manager\n\n## Network\n\n- CIDR: 10.20.30.0/24 · Gateway: 10.20.30.1 · VIP: 10.20.30.10\n- DNS: 10.20.30.2, 10.20.30.3 · NTP: 10.20.30.4, 10.20.30.5 · Domain: acme.lab\n- IP pool: 10.20.30.20 – 10.20.30.60\n- Firewall: yes · Air-gap: no · Load Balancer: yes\n- Proxy: HTTP http://proxy.acme.lab:3128 · HTTPS http://proxy.acme.lab:3128 · No proxy: localhost,127.0.0.1,0.0.0.0,10.20.30.0/24,.svc,.cluster.local,.acme.lab,10.20.30.10\n\n### VM / node inventory\n\n| Product | Role | vCPU | RAM (GB) | Disk (GB) | Hostname | IP |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| SUSE Virtualization | Management/HCI | 16 | 64 | 500 | virtualization-1 | 10.20.30.20 |\n| SUSE Virtualization | Management/HCI | 16 | 64 | 500 | virtualization-2 | 10.20.30.21 |\n| SUSE Virtualization | Management/HCI | 16 | 64 | 500 | virtualization-3 | 10.20.30.22 |\n| Rancher Prime | Rancher Server | 8 | 16 | 80 | rancher-1 | 10.20.30.23 |\n| SUSE Observability | Observability | 8 | 32 | 300 | observability-1 | 10.20.30.24 |\n| SUSE Multi-Linux Manager | Multi-Linux Manager Server | 4 | 32 | 230 | manager-1 | 10.20.30.25 |\n| Downstream cluster | Downstream cluster (security, storage, registry · pulls from Application Collection) | 8 | 16 | 150 | downstream-1 | 10.20.30.26 |\n\n## Air-gapped ISOs (EIB)\n\n| Profile | Contents | FQDN | IP |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K3s + cert-manager + Rancher Prime | rancher-1.acme.lab | 10.20.30.23 |\n| 2 | K3s + Longhorn + NeuVector + Harbor | downstream-1.acme.lab | 10.20.30.26 |\n| 3 | K3s + SUSE Observability | observability-1.acme.lab | 10.20.30.24 |\n\n## Test plan\n\n| Priority | Total | Demonstrated | Pending |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| must-have | 43 | 25 | 11 |\n| nice-to-have | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n\n---\n\n_Credentials, passwords and tokens are left out of this document on purpose._\n"
